      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Summary\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented two-bedroom ground-floor apartment in the highly sought-after Melrose Court development, ideally positioned on Upper George’s Street and just moments from Wexford’s vibrant Main Street. Offering the perfect combination of location, convenience and lifestyle, this superb property is quite literally on the doorstep of an outstanding range of shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, pubs and high-street retailers, while the train and bus stations, schools, medical facilities and Wexford Quay are all within easy walking distance. The well-proportioned accommodation comprises two generous double bedrooms, a family shower room and a spacious kitchen, dining and living area, creating a comfortable and highly practical home. As a ground-floor apartment, the property also bene\u001dfits from its own private patio area, providing a wonderful spot to enjoy your morning coffee or unwind outdoors. Presented to the market in excellent condition, this is a turnkey property with strong appeal to fi\u001drst-time buyers, owner-occupiers, downsizers and investors alike.\r\nThe location also puts the very best of Wexford town and the surrounding area within easy reach. Enjoy leisurely walks along the picturesque Wexford Quays, explore the town’s rich Viking and medieval heritage, or catch a performance at the renowned National Opera House. For days out, the beautiful Curracloe Beach, Johnstown Castle, Irish National Heritage Park and the spectacular Hook Lighthouse are all among the many attractions County Wexford has to offer. With such a central address, excellent accommodation and the convenience of having virtually everything on your doorstep, Melrose Court represents a fantastic opportunity to secure a home or investment in one of Wexford town’s most desirable and established locations.\r\n\r\nVIEWING HIGHLY RECOMMENDED"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch - (1.5m x 1.2m), Tiled floor, door to\r\nHall - (7.2m x 1.0m + 1.9m x 1.0m), Laminate floor, hotpress and storage off.\r\nLiving/Dining Area - (4.9m x 3.9m), Laminate floor, coving, opening to\r\nKitchen - (2.3m x 2.3m), Eye and waist level units, plumbed for washing machine, coving, tiled floor and splashback\r\nBedroom No. 1 - (2.9m x 2.7m), Laminate floor, coving.\r\nBedroom No. 2 - (3.8m x 2.9m), Laminate floor, coving, feature panelling, patio door to outside.\r\nShower room - (3.8m x 2.9m), WC, WHB, Shower, fully tiled.\r\n\r\nOutside: Patio area, gated communal area with parking.\r\nServices: Electricity, mains water, mains sewerage, electric heating.\r\nBER: D2 Ber No: 112511902 Performance indicator: 267.04 Wh/m2/yr"
